# Web UX

- Single page, one depth: `/` landing ↔ in-place watch (`#watch`). One CTA click enters watch.
- Landing first viewport = brand **Kostolany Watch**, one headline, one sub line, CTA group, dominant egg.
- Watch first viewport = brand, one line, asset/model controls (auto-fetch on change), dominant egg.
- No cards in hero; no floating badges on the egg.
- Keep disclaimer visible near actions/recommendations.
- Preserve Fraunces + IBM Plex + moss palette unless redesigning intentionally.
- API via Vite proxy `/api` → FastAPI (`kostolany serve` on :8000).
